<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>HDIBS - 科学之光</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { 
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
            background: #f5f5f5;
            color: #333;
        }
        nav {
            background: #1a1a2e;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }
        nav .brand {
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 24px;
            font-weight: bold;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        nav ul {
            list-style: none;
            display: flex;
            gap: 30px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }
        nav ul li { position: relative; }
        nav ul li a {
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 8px 15px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }
        nav ul li a:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
        
        /* Dropdown menu */
        .dropdown {
            position: absolute;
            top: 100%;
            left: 0;
            background: #1a1a2e;
            border-radius: 5px;
            min-width: 150px;
            display: none;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }
        .dropdown-trigger:hover .dropdown { display: block; }
        .dropdown li { width: 100%; }
        .dropdown li a { display: block; width: 100%; }
        
        /* Second level dropdown */
        .sub-dropdown {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 100%;
            background: #1a1a2e;
            border-radius: 5px;
            min-width: 120px;
            display: none;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
        }
        .dropdown-second { position: relative; }
        .dropdown-second:hover .sub-dropdown { display: block; }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 50px auto;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .hero {
            background: #fff;
            padding: 60px;
            border-radius: 15px;
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
            text-align: center;
        }
        .hero h1 {
            font-size: 36px;
            color: #1a1a2e;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .hero p {
            font-size: 18px;
            color: #666;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        .welcome-block {
            font-size: 36px;
            color: #1a1a2e;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            display: block;
        }
        .logout {
            position: absolute;
            right: 30px;
            top: 15px;
        }
        .logout a {
            color: #fff;
            text-decoration: none;
            padding: 8px 15px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            border-radius: 5px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <nav>
        <a href="/client/home" class="brand">HDIBS</a>
        <a href="/logout" class="logout">退出</a>
        <ul>
            <li><a href="/client/about">关于我们</a></li>
            <li><a href="/client/members">社团成员</a></li>
            <li class="dropdown-trigger">
                <a href="#">路径资源 ▾</a>
                <ul class="dropdown">
                    <li class="dropdown-second">
                        <a href="#">物理学 ▸</a>
                        <ul class="sub-dropdown">
                            <li><a href="/client/resource/physics/optics">光学</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/client/resource/physics/mechanics">力学</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/client/resource/physics/electricity">电学</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/client/resource/physics/quantum">量子力学</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/client/resource/physics/thermal">热学</a></li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                    <li class="dropdown-second">
                        <a href="#">化学 ▸</a>
                        <ul class="sub-dropdown">
                            <li><a href="/client/resource/chemistry/inorganic">无机化学</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/client/resource/chemistry/organic">有机化学</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/client/resource/chemistry/environmental">环境化学</a></li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                    <li class="dropdown-second">
                        <a href="#">生物学 ▸</a>
                        <ul class="sub-dropdown">
                            <li><a href="/client/resource/biology/neuro">神经生物学</a></li>
                            <li><a href="/client/resource/biology/other">其他生物学</a></li>
                        </ul>
                    </li>
                </ul>
            </li>
        </ul>
    </nav>
    
    <div class="container">
        <div class="hero">
            <h1><span class="welcome-block">欢迎，</span>希望你可以在这里燃起你对科学的兴趣。</h1>
            <p>探索科学的奥秘，开启智慧的大门</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
